<TopicLayout slug="heaven/imagine" noImage>

  <p>
    We do not need to pursue the beauties of this world, nor the seven wonders, nor the thrill of the exotic, nor the most glorious vaction destinations. We need not waste our time and money. We will see the best. We will experience the best. For God has reserved the best for us in the new heavens and the new Earth of Eternity.
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li>
    "However, as it is written: “What no eye has seen, what no ear has heard, and what no human mind has conceived” — the things God has prepared for those who love him—these are the things God has revealed to us by his Spirit..." - 1 Corinthians 2:9
    </li>

    <li>
      "How priceless is your unfailing love, O God! People take refuge in the shadow of your wings. They feast on the abundance of your house; you give them drink from your river of delights. For with you is the fountain of life; in your light we see light." <br>- Psalms 36:7-9<br />
    </li>

    <li>
      "And God raised us up with Christ and seated us with him in the heavenly realms in Christ Jesus, <b>in order</b> that in the coming ages he might <b>show</b> the <b>incomparable</b> riches of his grace, expressed in his kindness to us in Christ Jesus." - Ephesians 2:6-7
        <span class="meditation">
          <b>Meditation: God saved us in order that He might show us the riches of His incomparable favor. Imajine your most desired riches, dreams, or wants; they are not comparable to what He will be showing us!</b>
      </span>
    </li>

    <li>
      "How lovely is your dwelling place, Lord Almighty!" - Psalms 84:1
    </li>
  </ul>
